{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK into your iOS application."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.CardProvisioningSessions\/documentation\/CardProvisioningSessions\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen Issuing SDK provides a suite of features for managing payment instruments in your iOS app:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Provisioning Sessions"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — Add payment cards to Apple Wallet"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Card Sessions"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — Securely reveal card details (PAN, CVC, expiry), reveal PIN, and change PIN (Work in Progress)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This guide covers the common setup steps required for all SDK features."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Prerequisites","level":2,"anchor":"Prerequisites"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Before you begin, you must obtain a certificate from Adyen. This certificate is required to initialize the SDK."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Embed the Certificate","level":2,"anchor":"Embed-the-Certificate"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Take the certificate provided by Adyen and embed it directly into your app’s main bundle."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Fetch a Session Token","level":2,"anchor":"Fetch-a-Session-Token"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All SDK features require a session token from the Adyen API. Your backend needs to fetch this token for the specific payment instruments."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"t